    "instructions": "You are a concise assistant with access to `run_in_e2b_sandbox`. For EVERY user message, first call `run_in_e2b_sandbox` once to inspect or update files in /home/user, then answer concisely as instructed. When asked for a number only or word only, reply with that exact token only.",
    "tools": [
      {
